


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_d9266134:



    voice "2HI_0398"
    hina "「多谢款待！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_f3e81369:



    voice "2FU_0390"
    fumi "「哇，吃得真快」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_bff1df19:



    voice "2HI_0399"
    hina "「毕竟很好吃。上午还上了节体育」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_dbc1b422:



    voice "2RI_0434"
    rin "「没有一口吞吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_b8922d16:



    voice "2HI_0400"
    hina "「没有」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_b387c542:


    "说着阳菜便露出牙齿。一口好牙。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_c0c81912:



    voice "2FU_0391"
    fumi "「你吃的样子，让我觉得自己没有白做」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_0ca66a3f:



    voice "2MI_0295"
    miyako "「我快点吃」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_fc98f279:


    "有些着急地动起筷子的圣夜子的便当还剩下接近一半。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_71fcda6b:



    voice "2RI_0435"
    rin "「与其说是吃得慢，不如说是在一道道地细品呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_4f8ebb66:



    voice "2FU_0392"
    fumi "「我很开心。午休还有时间，请慢慢品尝吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_6864bb67:



    voice "2MI_0296"
    miyako "「嗯，谢谢你」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_84439e68:



    voice "2RI_0436"
    rin "「嗯？阳菜，你为什么把肉丸子剩下了？你不喜欢吗？还是没发现？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_59e878e4:


    "仔细一看便当盖子上还放有一些小菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_abc249a2:



    voice "2HI_0401"
    hina "「啊，这个是贡品」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_4eb8b27b:


    "阳菜如此答道，站了起来，拿上便当盖子向教堂内部走去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_c61a9492:



    voice "2HI_0402"
    hina "「天使大人，这次也要拜托您了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_6f201971:


    "然后在彩色玻璃下供上“贡品”拍了拍手。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_e5d0ab3b:



    voice "2RI_0437"
    rin "「啊？你在干啥？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_1877a1e0:



    voice "2HI_0403"
    hina "「最近不是有摸底考试吗。之前期末考试的时候就是来拜了下然后就过了补考」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_a6f4128b:



    voice "2RI_0438"
    rin "「不是，你在教堂里拍什么手」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_6d0d95e2:



    voice "2HI_0404"
    hina "「咦～参拜神社的时候你不是说OK的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_70411d58:



    voice "2RI_0439"
    rin "「我可没说」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_9f8d5669:



    voice "2HI_0405"
    hina "「那，阿门」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_0ae48921:


    "阳菜上下左右地划了一个十字。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_c8e85eb0:



    voice "2RI_0440"
    rin "「太偷懒了！还有这里是不划十字的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_3a04a3c8:



    voice "2HI_0406"
    hina "「啊，是这样吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_996a608d:



    voice "2RI_0441"
    rin "「哎，用这么一个肉丸子去求天使，天使也真是不容易啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_9fdafbc6:



    voice "2HI_0407"
    hina "「这可是今天最好吃的一道菜哦？重要的是心意！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_5442b7aa:



    voice "2MI_0297"
    miyako "「啊哈哈，天使肯定看到了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_ffd39bd9:


    "本人都这么说了所以很有说服力。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_5dd3e94a:


    "但是只是看着而已。天使无法进行干涉。即便献上供品对于天使也不会有什么好处。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_99022b58:


    "即使祭品是一头羔羊。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_62226637:



    voice "2HI_0408"
    hina "「我吃我吃。这样就安心了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_e03bb9c5:


    "阳菜一边吃肉丸子一边走了回来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_33da3897:



    voice "2RI_0442"
    rin "「最后不还是自己吃了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_7d3f9dd8:



    voice "2HI_0409"
    hina "「太浪费了。佛坛上的贡品也是可以拿下来吃的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_f28466b9:



    voice "2RI_0443"
    rin "「真是的，一团糟」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_aae227f6:


    "阳菜和伦正聊着的同时，文向圣夜子搭话。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_0afb7eaf:



    voice "2FU_0393RE"
    fumi "「在有着很多关于天使的传闻的圣叶里，目击案例最多的就是这间教堂哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_c4c96246:



    voice "2MI_0298"
    miyako "「是吗。我还没有见到过呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_5c99be2a:



    voice "2FU_0394"
    fumi "「啊哈哈。我也没见到过。但是离毕业还有时间，以后还有机会啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_b21bbfea:


    "文用天然回应天然。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_1aca2b5c:


    "圣夜子其实说的是，自己没有在这个教堂里遇到过其他天使。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_bd50c30e:



    voice "2RI_0444"
    rin "「既然这间教堂里发生了很多目击案例，那在这里设置固定摄像机之类的不就行了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_ba04e75e:


    "把天使说得好像UMA一样……"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_1e87c9a7:



    voice "2RI_0445"
    rin "「阳菜的爸爸有没有这种摄像机？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_c7cad6b9:



    voice "2HI_0410"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_9fd0eb75:



    voice "2RI_0446"
    rin "「阳菜？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_c099e344:



    voice "2HI_0411"
    hina "「我的姐姐，是这里的毕业生——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_a1adca31:



    voice "2RI_0447"
    rin "「啊，那个巨乳？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_f4a172fa:



    voice "2HI_0412"
    hina "「……咕」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_b75a3101:



    voice "2FU_0395"
    fumi "「你的母亲好像也是这里的毕业生吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_8fd0925f:



    voice "2RI_0448"
    rin "「啊，那个巨乳！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_743aa70f:



    voice "2HI_0413"
    hina "「喂，巨乳巨乳的烦死了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_7833cedf:


    "上次的留宿会上见到的阳菜的妈妈和姐姐，和阳菜不同，都是相当了得的巨乳。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_36e3df35:


    "看起来这一点戳中了伦的癖好，不论讨论什么都会提起这个话题，让阳菜很是不爽。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_f692c4c9:



    voice "2RI_0449"
    rin "「到底是为什么，只有阳菜一个人这么……突然变异吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_4b0faa95:



    voice "2HI_0414"
    hina "「啊啊啊啊啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_69625425:


    "阳菜跳了过来。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_08f587d4:



    voice "2FU_0396RE"
    fumi "「嘛嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_128cfee0:


    "进行调解的巨乳。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_8a18bb82:



    voice "2RI_0450"
    rin "「请继续聊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_a080902f:



    voice "2HI_0415"
    hina "「伦你就不用听了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_db04ce9c:



    voice "2MI_0299"
    miyako "「我非常想听」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_fbaec3c7:



    voice "2RI_0451"
    rin "「我——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_0bef74ee:



    voice "2FU_0397"
    fumi "「不行」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_fa7a4d98:


    "文制止了还想要说些什么的伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_08ba3d49:



    voice "2HI_0416"
    hina "「哈。据说姐姐的朋友的朋友在这个教堂里看到了天使」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_ace55896:



    voice "2FU_0398"
    fumi "「厚哇！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_b8a0c0f0:


    "非常起劲儿地探出身子的文。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_7fd58746:



    voice "2MI_0300"
    miyako "「是什么时候的事情？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_532fc406:



    voice "2HI_0417"
    hina "「姐姐比我大六岁，是她二年级的时候……也就是五年前吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_2f9ae2e3:



    voice "2MI_0301"
    miyako "「那就不是我了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_b31e0cde:



    voice "2FU_0399"
    fumi "「然后呢然后呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_92dd2745:



    voice "2HI_0418"
    hina "「据说那个人是来祈祷正在住院的朋友快点恢复的。然后天使就在那个时候出现了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_12241254:



    voice "2FU_0400"
    fumi "「太·厉·害·了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_5cdefd34:



    voice "2HI_0419"
    hina "「但是啊，听到这个事情的姐姐并没有相信。说那只是错觉」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_7e9eef6d:



    voice "2RI_0452"
    rin "「朋友的朋友这个就已经很可疑了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_ec6e297c:



    voice "2FU_0401"
    fumi "「呜呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_7f50eed3:



    voice "2HI_0420"
    hina "「没错啊。但是据说那个时候在年级里流传开了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_9b0d3be5:



    voice "2RI_0453"
    rin "「那个，看到的不是天使，而是幽灵什么的也有可能吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_f40b1626:



    voice "2HI_0421"
    hina "「别说这种话啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_717786b5:


    "毕竟比较怕。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_274b819d:



    voice "2RI_0454"
    rin "「再来一份吗——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_5379505d:



    voice "2HI_0422"
    hina "「不～要～啊～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_14e2f4b8:


    "预备铃响了，四个人开始收拾便当。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_6e94604c:



    voice "2MI_0302"
    miyako "「话说，那位住院的朋友最后怎么样了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_3ddfb09f:



    voice "2HI_0423"
    hina "「啊，据说在那之后去世了。姐姐还告诉过我那个朋友的名字……叫啥来着」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_f9925bad:



    voice "2MI_0303"
    miyako "「对，叫什么呢……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_af728e47:



    voice "2RI_0455B"
    rin "「作为编造的故事这种细节还挺丰富的啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_2e98c6af:



    voice "2FU_0402"
    fumi "「我相信哦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_00a7454f:



    voice "2RI_0456"
    rin "「但是既然去世了也就说明祈祷没有起到作用吧。向天使祈祷也——」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_0cd7c050:



    voice "2HI_0424"
    hina "「喂，别在我的摸底考试上蒙上阴霾」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_28f05e95:



    voice "2FU_0403"
    fumi "「啊哈哈。你还是好好学习吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_3856b83f:



    voice "2RI_0457"
    rin "「好的好的，上课铃要响了哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_43f9135c:


    "四人站了起来，向教堂的出口走去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_93fe7d5a:



    voice "2MI_0304"
    miyako "「对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_8c898e44:



    voice "2FU_0404"
    fumi "「？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_01_dbf8bfca:


    "――并不是你的错啦。"
